# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/build/
/coverage/

# The browser OCR engine: 38 MB fetched by
# `dart run flutter_card_scanner_plus:install_web`, not committed.
example/web/flutter_card_scanner_plus/

# Build inputs for the worker bundle in assets/, which is committed.
# package-lock.json is committed on purpose: it pins the bytes that end up
# in the bundle, so CI can check the committed bundle still matches.
tool/ocr_worker/node_modules/
